    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been on warfarin for a few months now for my heart stuff. i really want to start eating much healthier and get more nutrients in. is it okay if i start eating way more spinach and kale in my smoothies every morning? i want to really lean into the greens to help my heart.",
